                "This is a 14 karat white gold double cherry shaped charm. Set into the cherries are 7 genuine Round pink sapphires. The 5 sapphires in the larger cherry in front weigh 0.035 Carat and the 4 sapphires in the smaller cherry weigh 0.031 Carat. Set into the leaf at the top of the cherries are 2 Round full cut diamonds of \"H\"-\"I\" color and I-1 clarity. One diamond weighs 0.005 Carat and the other weighs 0.010 Carat. This piece is sold by the jewelry company, Stuller."@en;
