                "This is a pendant containing 2 Pear shaped London Blue topaz gemstones, one at the top and one at the bottom, with the tips of the Pear shaped stones facing each other. Separating these 2 faceted stones are 5 Round full cut diamonds weighing 0.01 Carat each, for a total diamond weight of 0.05 Carat. The bottom topaz weighs 2.07 Carat and the top one weighs 0.76 Carat. The pendant is fabricated in sterling silver."@en;
