        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                "This is a 14 karat white gold anniversary band. It is set with alternating Round diamonds and Princess cut sapphires. The 4 diamonds are of \"H\"-\"I\" color and SI-1 to SI-2 clarity and weigh 0.05 Carat each. The 4 sapphires are of AA quality and weigh 0.119 Carat each. All stones are bezel set and have etchings in the gold surrounding each bezel. The total gemstone weight is 1/5 Carat. This ring is sized to a 7 and the piece is sold by the jewelry company, Stuller."@en;
