        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                "This is a pair of inside outside diamond hoop earrings featuring diamonds down front of the earrings, as well as on the inside back, allowing diamonds to be seen throughout the earrings when worn. These diamonds are Round full cut, of \"H\"-\"J\" color and I-1 clarity. The total diamond weight is 3/4 Carat. The earrings contain 34 diamonds down the front weighing 0.015 Carat each. There are 20 diamonds inside each hoop weighing 0.013 Carat each. The earrings have a hinged clasp."@en;
